* LVS reference for layout/cell_candidate2_fallback/cell_candidate2_fallback.gds.
* Source: spec/run3-test-chip-floorplan.md "Variant C2-fallback" and
* spec/run3-bench-plan.md section 9 (issue #372) -- there is no schematic
* netlist for this variant (it exists only as specified prose and this
* drawing). Two bare cap_nmos_06v0 capacitors, one per ratified
* capacitor-geometry level (spec/capacitor-geometry-decision.md, Region II:
* Gmin W=1.0u x L=0.70u, G2x W=2.0u x L=0.70u), no access device, gate
* private per block (PL_GMIN / PL_G2X), S and D strapped together on the
* shared BL, bodies tied on VB. Same literal dimensions as the two C2
* subcircuits of layout/run3_top/run3_top.spice, minus the XM1 access
* device.
.subckt cell_candidate2_fallback BL PL_GMIN PL_G2X VB
XC1 BL PL_GMIN cap_nmos_06v0 c_width=1.0u c_length=0.70u m=1
XC2 BL PL_G2X cap_nmos_06v0 c_width=2.0u c_length=0.70u m=1
.ends
